        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    strike_price = 145\n    final_stock_price = 140\n    premium_per_share = 3.25\n    contracts = 5\n    shares_per_contract = 100\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    intrinsic_value_per_share = max(strike_price - final_stock_price, 0)\n    profit_per_share = intrinsic_value_per_share - premium_per_share\n    total_profit = profit_per_share * contracts * shares_per_contract\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_profit)\n```",
